WEBVTT

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:11.040
All right, so this must be where he is...

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:14.500
Hey!

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.500
You there! Get off that ladder!

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:18.130
Don't try and stop me!

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:22.790
It's taking everything that I have
to hold back my urge to fight right now!

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:25.130
Get in my way...

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.670
<b>That Mizunokoji Boy</b>

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:26.670
and you'll regret it!

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:29.380
<b>KAWHOMP!</b>

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:30.040
Jeez, I tried to warn you...

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:06.250
<b>The 19** XXth Annual</b>

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:06.250
<b>TOMOBIKI HIGH SCHOOL</b>

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:06.250
<b>SPORTS TOURNAMENT</b>

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:12.080
Go Mendo!

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:14.580
You totally got this!

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:16.670
Just watch. I'm going to get a home run!

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:19.880
Darling! Go for it!

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:22.380
Hey, Ataru!

00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:23.630
Remember the deal?

00:02:23.630 --> 00:02:24.420
Yeah!

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:26.040
Make sure that he can hit it.

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.250
I've got it covered.

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:28.500
If we wanna make sure our bet pays off,

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:30.920
then throwing the match
is way easier than winning it.

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:33.460
Yeah. And if we end up losing this game...

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:35.420
We score 10 free pool tickets!

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:37.250
Hurry up!

00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:38.170
Quit wasting time!

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:38.920
Coming!

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:39.880
Fools.

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:40.880
Sorry about that.

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:43.830
Nobody steals my spotlight.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.130
Found him.

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:47.080
Take this!

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:50.750
<b>WHAMO!</b>

00:02:49.670 --> 00:02:50.920
Wow! He hit it!

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:51.960
Huge foul!

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:53.830
You don't have to say it like that, dammit!

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:56.170
<b>KA-THUD!</b>

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:01.460
Uh oh, it hit somebody!

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:02.290
Yikes...

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:03.080
Is he okay?

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:03.920
This is bad.

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:05.170
Who is that guy?

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:06.000
Dunno.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.540
Hey. You alive, kid?

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.000
Fine and dandy!

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:13.630
He ate the ball!

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:14.540
Hey!
He ate the ball!<b></b>

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:16.420
My apologies, are you okay?

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:17.750
Oh. Hello Shu.

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:19.960
I know you! You're Ton!

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:21.830
You came back from the mountains?!

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:24.170
Friend of yours?

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:24.920
Yeah.

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:28.710
Tobimaro Mizunokoji. He's the heir to
the Mizunokoji Sports empire.

00:03:28.710 --> 00:03:31.790
Whoa, Mizunokoji Sports?
That's one of the biggest brands around!

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:33.750
So what's your relationship to him, Mendo?

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:36.130
The Mendos are descendants of samurai.

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:38.290
While the Mizunokojis are
descendants of nobility.

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:40.420
So our families didn't exactly get along.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:43.580
And as a result, we spent a lot of time
quarreling as children.

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:45.920
Then, one fateful day...

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:47.580
Here I go, Shu!

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:49.380
Bring it on, Ton!

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.630
I walked away the victor.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:57.630
Because a bat does more damage than a ball.

00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:59.080
What kinda fight is that?

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:01.830
Ever since that day,
I secluded myself in the mountains.

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:04.750
And threw everything I had
into training for baseball.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:09.580
I return just one day a year, so that I can
challenge and defeat Shu in a match!

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:11.670
What's the score between you?

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:13.710
Eleven matches that
resulted in eleven draws.

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:15.330
Somehow things always end
with a stalemate.

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:16.290
Listen, Shu!

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:19.790
What?! That's crazy!

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:20.750
I swear to you...

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:22.710
upon this ball right here!

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:25.170
I'm going to walk away
the winner this time!

00:04:25.670 --> 00:04:27.080
Now's a bad time, Ton.

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.130
My school is in the middle of
a sports tournament today.

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:30.380
Our showdown will have to wait for later.

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:31.080
Clip clop, clip clop...
Our showdown will have to wait for later.<b></b>

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.380
Clip clop, clip clop...
Are you serious?!<b></b>

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:33.290
Clip clop, clip clop...
Dear Brother!<b></b>

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:34.630
Please wait a moment!

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.210
Ryoko?!

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.380
Ryoko, my sweet!

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:38.580
Are you here to cheer me on?

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:40.420
Master Moroboshi! How nice to see you.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:42.630
Ryoko, baby, you're looking gorgeous today!

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:43.960
By the way...

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:44.670
Darling!
...when you've got some free time,<b>
</b>do you wanna hit up the pool with me?<b></b>

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:45.000
...when you've got some free time,
do you wanna hit up the pool with me?

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:46.040
Brother...
...when you've got some free time,<b>
</b>do you wanna hit up the pool with me?<b></b>

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:46.540
...when you've got some free time,
do you wanna hit up the pool with me?

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:50.040
Master Tobimaro came all this way
just so he could have a match against you.

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:52.500
It would be rude of you
to brush him off like that.

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.630
She's right! You have to face me!

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:55.630
Don't chicken out!

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:57.210
Who're you calling a chicken, dammit?!

00:04:57.540 --> 00:05:00.040
Master Moroboshi? I have a request.

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:03.500
Please allow Master Tobimaro
to join your team for today.

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:06.710
Hold on, Ryoko. Why're you bothering
to help this guy out, anyway?

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:08.000
Well, you see...

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:11.880
Master Tobimaro is actually...

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:14.170
The first man...

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.130
to be my lover!

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:17.130
WHAT?!

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:19.290
SCUMBAG!
WHEN'D YOU LAY YOUR HANDS ON HER?!

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:20.580
SHE'S LYING!

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:23.540
Or rather, who I hope will be someday!

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:27.380
Middle schoolers are
pretty precocious these days, huh?

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:30.960
Ever since we were kids,
I have pined after him.

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:32.880
Aw jeez, Ryoko!

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:37.460
Those are such fond memories.

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:39.130
Quit living in your own fantasy!

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:41.460
I absolutely detest women!

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:43.210
Very well, Ryoko.

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:44.210
However...

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:47.210
I'll agree to let Ton play,
but only if you make a wager with me.

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:48.000
Huh?

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:51.250
If I win this match,
then you'll have to give up on dating him!

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:52.830
Fine then.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:55.580
I will forget all about Master Tobimaro
if you win the game, Brother.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:56.710
I'll hold you to that.

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:57.630
Wait a sec!

00:05:57.630 --> 00:06:00.080
We can't have a change
in team members right now!

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.330
Besides, we don't even know
if he's good or not!

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:04.420
Oh, you don't have to worry about that.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:07.790
I've spent years shedding blood, sweat,
and tears to become the best there is.

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:10.210
Dude, this could backfire.

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:12.040
If he's really that good,
we'll end up winning.

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:14.330
All right. We're gonna test him first.

00:06:14.670 --> 00:06:16.080
Let's see you swing a bat.

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:18.290
What the?

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:19.710
Try throwing next.

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:23.130
Okay, you pass!

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:25.420
Huh?! Are you sure about this, darling?

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:26.460
Yeah.

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:28.960
He's exactly the type of player
we need for our team.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:31.080
Talk about spectacularly uncoordinated...

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.040
Yep. He's gonna prove really useful.

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:34.420
Or wait, I mean useless.

00:06:34.420 --> 00:06:35.170
Whatever!

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:37.580
Welcome, Tobimaro! Glad to have you!

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.790
Great. I'll pull my weight!

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:45.000
<b>TEAM</b>

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:45.000
<b>MENDO</b>

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:45.000
<b>ATARU</b>

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:45.000
This is it. It's currently zero to zero
and we're in the last inning with two outs.

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:48.170
We can't afford to score
a single point no matter what.

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:49.960
Pinch hitter time!

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:51.170
Good luck!

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:52.080
You can do it!

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:53.040
Kick some butt!

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:54.500
Knock it outta here!

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:57.380
Okay, Ton.
Today we settle this once and for all!

00:06:57.380 --> 00:06:59.330
You're going down, Shu!

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:02.210
Oh, Master Tobimaro. Please hit it.

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:05.750
Strike!

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:07.630
Nice!

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:08.460
That's what I'm talking about.

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:10.000
What are you so happy about?

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.710
I'm not happy at all!

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:14.380
Master Tobimaro. You must hit it.

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:16.080
No matter what it takes.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.040
Here it goes.

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:21.000
I'm hitting it this time for sure!

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:22.460
Goooooo!

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:23.960
<b>CLUTCH!</b>

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.290
What are you doing?!

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:26.380
Hey!

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.500
The ball... looks like it's frozen in place!

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:33.130
Oh my! He hit it!

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:33.920
Crap!

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:34.920
Alright!

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:37.170
How is this fair?!

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:38.790
Don't let him touch firs- garh!

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:39.000
<b>BWARGH!</b>

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:41.960
You're not getting past us!

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:42.920
<b>WHAP!</b>

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:46.170
Uh oh! It got past the outfielders!

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:48.710
We gotta get that ball back!

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:50.750
Darling! Why are you trying to stop it?!

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:53.330
Letting it go would mean we win!

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:55.170
He's gone past second!

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:58.130
Winning would be bad!

00:07:58.460 --> 00:07:59.920
Now he's past third!

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:01.920
Awesome! An inside-the-park home run!

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:03.380
This means I beat Shu!

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:04.670
Not so fast!

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:06.580
I'm throwing it home!

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:08.830
Why the hell is Ataru running defense
for the other team?!

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:11.670
Shake a leg! You can outpace the runner!

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:19.250
<b>KA-WHUMP</b>

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:21.830
Wh-what on earth...?

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:24.210
When did home base become a trap hole?

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:25.460
Oh no, darling!

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:26.580
Yippee!

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:29.040
They fell for it, they fell for it!

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:32.460
RYOKO! WHAT THE HELL IS WRONG WITH YOU?!

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:34.580
N-now's my chance to get him out...

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:40.500
GULP!

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:41.920
He swallowed it again!

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:44.080
Dammit! Spit that back up!

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:52.540
Dude! What kind of wacky training
have you been doing in those mountains?!

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:57.130
It took everything I had... just to stay alive.

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:59.290
Master Tobimaro...

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:01.880
YOU GOTTA BE KIDDING!

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:04.790
WHAT IS THERE TO LIKE
ABOUT THIS NUMBSKULL?!

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:05.920
Sweet! Extra innings!
WHAT IS THERE TO LIKE<b>
</b>ABOUT THIS NUMBSKULL?!<b></b>

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:07.540
We're gonna win this thing!
WHAT IS THERE TO LIKE<b>
</b>ABOUT THIS NUMBSKULL?!<b></b>

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:14.170
<b>Mendo Estate, Japanese Garden</b>

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:16.040
Every morning, Shu crosses this bridge
at precisely 6 o'clock.

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:18.670
I know this for an absolute fact!

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:20.420
He will be here!

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:23.170
<b>Same Location, Main Bulding</b>

00:09:21.170 --> 00:09:22.330
Have you found the young master?!

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:23.170
No luck.

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:24.670
I didn't see him over that way.

00:09:24.920 --> 00:09:26.130
Something's wrong.

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:29.630
The young master has never missed
his morning walk with the octopuses.

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:31.210
Where could he have gone?

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:31.710
Clip clop, clip clop...

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:33.250
What's the matter?
Clip clop, clip clop...<b></b>

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:35.000
Why all the ruckus this morning?

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:35.960
Lady Ryoko!

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:38.460
I'm sorry to say,
but the young master is missing!

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:40.380
Are you serious?

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:49.500
I knew you'd come, Shu!

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:51.710
I can't believe my brother.

00:09:51.710 --> 00:09:53.710
How could he abandon you guys?

00:09:53.710 --> 00:09:55.290
Just you wait, Shu.

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:57.790
I'll make sure you can't miss
this challenge letter of mine!

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:01.790
Special delivery! Take it, Shu!

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:03.170
<b>BONK</b>

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:05.460
Oh my.

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:07.080
What might this be?

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:15.830
<b>Today at noon,</b>

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:15.830
<b>I will await you at</b>

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:15.830
<b>Mizunokoji Athletic Land!!</b>

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:15.830
<b>From Ton♥</b>

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:14.500
Today at noon, I will await you
at Mizunokoji Athletic Land!

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:15.830
From Ton.

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:18.040
Could it be...?

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:19.880
A love letter?!

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:22.420
Oh, Master Tobimaro!

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:26.460
<b>WHAM!</b>

00:10:27.290 --> 00:10:28.790
How delightful!

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:31.250
Ryoko...

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:34.920
<b>Shu</b>

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.210
Dear Brother!

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:38.920
There you are!
Where on earth have you been, Brother?

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:40.960
And why do you look so exhausted?

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:42.880
AS IF YOU DIDN'T ALREADY KNOW, DAMMIT!

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:44.330
Whatever do you mean?

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:47.330
You can't stand there and tell me
you forgot about yesterday!

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:49.540
Guess who?

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:51.420
Enough with the jokes, Ryoko.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:54.630
Aw shucks.
How did you know that it was me?

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:57.210
Because I know you well enough
to foresee every move you make.

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:58.670
Is that so?

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:58.040
<b>OKAY</b>

00:10:57.210 --> 00:11:00.170
<b>CEMENT</b>

00:10:58.290 --> 00:11:00.170
<b>GO</b>

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:00.170
That's very impressive, Brother.

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:02.580
You're never going to
outgrow these pranks, eh?

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:03.750
Who knows?

00:11:06.460 --> 00:11:07.960
Wh-what the hell, Ryoko!

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:10.170
GET ME OUTTA HERE!

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:14.960
Oh dear. And so you were
stuck there the entire time?

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:16.250
Until a few minutes ago.

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:18.250
What an awful experience!

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:20.040
Who could do something so terrible?!

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:22.210
DON'T PLAY DUMB WITH ME! YOU DID!

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:26.880
That was Ton's handwriting...

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:28.210
Ryoko!

00:11:30.170 --> 00:11:31.420
What is it?

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:34.130
You are forbidden from
leaving the estate at all today.

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:35.460
But Brother!

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:37.330
How could you do that to me?!

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:39.250
It's like I told you yesterday.

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:41.830
I can foresee every move
you're going to make.

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:43.210
Is that so?

00:11:44.710 --> 00:11:46.130
Kabloooey!

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:49.670
Let us take our leave.

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:50.670
Yes, milady!

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:53.380
Master Tobimaro...

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:55.880
I shall be in your arms soon!

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:58.630
N-not on my watch!

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:00.420
I refuse to let her date Ton!

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:03.000
Noooooo way in hell!

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:04.130
<b>Love Letter Trouble</b>

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:08.500
Ahhh. What a nice and lazy Sunday this is!

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:10.750
I overslept without even realizing it.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:12.080
Time to dig in!

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.960
<b>CRASH!</b>

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:15.000
MASTER MOROBOSHI!

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:15.920
You have a phone call.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:16.880
Huh?

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:18.790
Hello, who is it?

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:19.710
This is Ryoko!

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:21.460
Master Moroboshi, you must save me!

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:22.710
Wh-what's going on?

00:12:22.710 --> 00:12:25.290
I don't have time to explain right now!

00:12:25.290 --> 00:12:27.790
That's fine. You know I'm always
happy to help you, babe.

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:29.830
Thank you! I'll be right there!

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:31.250
<b>KER-SMASH!</b>

00:12:31.380 --> 00:12:32.080
Thud!

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:34.210
Hup!

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:35.330
Darling?!

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:37.250
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:38.460
Wait for me!

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:41.960
Jeez!

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:43.330
Darling!

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:45.830
So much for us having
a nice and lazy Sunday...

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:49.500
Where did you go?!

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:51.000
Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:54.170
Master Moroboshi.
My apologies for the sudden visit.

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:57.460
Ryoko, baby. What's got you all spooked?

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:01.420
I'm being hunted by my brother.

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:03.920
For no good reason at all!

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:06.500
You poor thing.

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:11.040
I've totally lost track of him.

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:18.540
<b>Today at noon, I will await you</b>

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:18.540
<b>at Mizunokoji Athletic Land!!</b>

00:13:14.210 --> 00:13:18.540
<b>From Ton♥</b>

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:17.960
I see how it is.

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:21.330
<b>Mizunokoji</b>

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:21.330
<b>Athletic Land</b>

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:21.330
<b>NOON</b>

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:22.000
<b>POLE CLIMBING</b>

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:24.750
<b>WHOOOSH</b>

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:24.750
What a nice wind.

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:28.750
Well, mother nature, I guess you're
as excited about this fight as I am!

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:29.960
<b>FHOOOOM!</b>

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:33.880
Better get down.

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:36.040
Ah...

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:41.170
Hey, what're you up to?

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:42.790
Wh-where'd you come from?!

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:44.290
Are you stuck up here?

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:45.130
No...

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:46.290
I can help you with that!

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:48.080
I don't need any help from a woman!

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:49.920
Come on, don't be like that.

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:51.040
Up we go!

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:55.330
Master Tobimaro!

00:13:55.630 --> 00:13:57.710
Is that Ryoko?! Why is she here?!

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:02.420
Master Tobimaro!

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:04.460
You climbing trees again, dude?

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:06.380
Oh, darling! There you are!

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:07.750
Aw crap! Lum?!

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:10.040
Just drop down, Master Tobimaro!

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:11.500
Nuh-uh! No way!

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:13.250
Heads up!

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:14.960
<b>KONK</b>

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:18.920
Master Tobimaro!

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:24.130
<b>KONK</b>

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:27.580
I've been aching to see you...

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:30.290
Wh-why did Ryoko come?

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:32.420
Is she here to stop our showdown?

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:33.750
Listen, Ryoko!

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:34.750
Yes?

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:37.380
You should know I'm dead set
on making this happen.

00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:38.380
Great!

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:41.540
<b>THWACK</b>

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:42.790
Allow me.

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:44.040
Darling!

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:48.210
<b>ZAP</b>

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:46.000
Get it through your thick head!

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:48.040
Ryoko has just been using you!

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:49.790
Forgive me, Master Moroboshi!

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:51.420
It's all true!

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:53.040
What is even going on?

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:55.380
The reason I asked
Master Moroboshi to come

00:14:55.380 --> 00:14:58.040
was to help prevent
my brother from interfering!

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.460
Oh, okay. I understand.

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:01.880
Master Moroboshi...

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:04.290
C'mon! Let's skedaddle
before Mendo shows up!

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:06.080
You don't understand anything!

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:07.330
<b>THWACK!</b>

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:08.290
Not on my watch!

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:10.380
I'd know that voice anywhere!

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:11.830
You got me.

00:15:11.830 --> 00:15:14.290
This is just a disguise that I used
to make my way here.

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:16.630
Beneath this mask, I am actually...!

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:18.040
TADAAAA!

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:19.460
One of my family's pet octopuses.

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:20.540
WRONG!

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:22.130
Brother! This isn't fair!

00:15:22.130 --> 00:15:23.670
You can't just disguise yourself!

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:26.670
I didn't bat an eye at the fact you
and Moroboshi were together

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:28.500
as I helped carry you here.
Do you know why?

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:29.790
Aw thanks, Mendo!

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:32.500
I'm so glad that you've accepted me
and Ryoko as a couple!

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:36.210
It's because you and your peabrain aren't
even on my radar as a potential threat!

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:37.250
Okay, Ton!

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:39.580
Now it's time for us to settle our score
once and for all!

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.000
I welcome the challenge.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:43.130
I WASN'T TALKING TO YOU!

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:44.170
Darling!

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:45.080
Get out of the way and be quiet!

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:46.380
H-hey! Lemme go!
Get out of the way and be quiet!<b></b>

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:47.080
H-hey! Lemme go!

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:49.750
That baseball match the other day
ended in a draw.

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:53.670
But this time there will be
a clear victor and loser.

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:55.210
Stop! Get this off me!

00:15:55.210 --> 00:15:57.130
You just keep your nose out of this, darling!

00:15:57.420 --> 00:15:59.250
It's been a long road...

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:01.210
I will defeat Shu!

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:03.290
<b>WHUMP</b>

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:04.790
I will defeat Shu!

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:05.710
<b>WHUMP</b>

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:07.420
Argh! I'm stuck!

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:08.750
I will defeat Shu!

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:09.460
<b>SMACK</b>

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:12.170
Filled with suffering.

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:13.460
How tragic.

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:14.880
More like pathetic.

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:16.710
I grit my teeth and endured

00:16:16.710 --> 00:16:19.630
training regiment after training regiment
all for this one purpose...

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:20.960
For victory!

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:22.790
You're going down, Shu!

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:26.210
I guess you're serious, huh, Ton?

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:28.500
There's no way in hell
I would ever joke about this!

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.960
Okay. I hear you.

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:32.540
Then in honor of your determination...

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:34.960
I will accept your relationship
with my sister!

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:35.670
Huh?

00:16:35.670 --> 00:16:37.670
Wonderful! Thank you, Brother!

00:16:37.670 --> 00:16:39.790
Hold the phone.
What are you talking abo-?

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:40.790
HOWEVER!

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:43.210
You're going to have to beat me first!

00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:44.960
Wait! Hold on a sec!

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:46.880
THE TIME FOR TALK IS OVER!

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:50.460
You better not have been
lying about that, Mendo!

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:51.420
Moroboshi?!

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:54.380
Because I'm gonna take Ryoko
for myself after I beat you!

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:56.630
You must be out of your mind!

00:16:57.630 --> 00:17:00.080
The time for talk is over!

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:01.580
Nice try!

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.830
Darling! We're going home, dang it!

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:11.330
Oh no!

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:16.710
Brother! Snap out of it! Say something!

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:18.000
He's gone out like a light.

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:19.380
O-oh crap!

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:21.750
We gotta run for it, babe!

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:23.460
Not again! Darling!
Master Moroboshi? What's wrong?<b></b>

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:25.460
Don't you remember
what the deal was, Ryoko?

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:29.250
You have to get hitched to
whoever defeats Mendo!

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:32.000
And right now, that means...

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:32.750
you're gonna end up being with Lum!

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:33.420
Let go of her this instant, mister!
you're gonna end up being with Lum!<b></b>

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:33.830
Let go of her this instant, mister!

00:17:33.830 --> 00:17:34.750
Let go of her this instant, mister!
No! How could fate be so cruel!<b></b>

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:36.750
No! How could fate be so cruel!

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:39.130
Enough, you moron!

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.500
<b>WHAMO!</b>

00:17:40.920 --> 00:17:42.630
I've got him this time!

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:44.210
D-dammit...

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:47.830
All these stupid jerks keep getting
in the way of our showdown!

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:50.000
Argh, stop it! I'm gonna turn into a giraffe!

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:51.960
Then just let go of Ryoko, dummy!

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:54.880
Master Moroboshi!
Please don't worry about me!

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:57.130
You gotta be kidding!
The fall will kill you!

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:59.290
I'm satisfied just knowing that you cared.

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:01.080
Farewell!

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:04.170
Ryoko, my sweet!

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:06.630
Bring it on, Shu! You're going down!

00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:12.960
Master Tobimaro!

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:15.920
I can't believe you put yourself
out there just to save me!

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:17.250
I'm so happy!

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:19.420
SMOOSH!

00:18:19.420 --> 00:18:21.250
No getting touchy-feely!

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:24.210
Stand up, Ton!
Or Ryoko will never be yours!

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:25.830
Cut the crap, Shu!

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:26.710
He got up.

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:29.500
Why the hell would I ever want to be
in a relationship with Ryoko?!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:30.830
Master Tobimaro...?

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:33.500
How dare you!
Don't try and give me that!

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:35.420
I know that you sent her a love letter, fool!

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:36.580
What love letter?!

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:39.250
I never sent anything like that.

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:40.250
Huh?

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:42.380
Why are you lying about it?

00:18:42.380 --> 00:18:43.960
I'm not lying!

00:18:43.960 --> 00:18:45.420
Are you talking about this?

00:18:45.420 --> 00:18:46.420
Let's see.

00:18:46.630 --> 00:18:49.630
Read it for yourselves!
It's nothing like a love letter!

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:54.000
"Today at noon, I will await you
at Mizunokoji Athletic Land!"

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:56.540
"From Ton" with a heart mark...?

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:56.540
<b>Today at noon, I will await you</b>

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:56.540
<b>at Mizunokoji Athletic Land!!</b>

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:56.540
<b>From Ton♥</b>

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:59.000
I KNEW IT WAS A FREAKING LOVE LETTER!

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:01.500
IT'S NOT A LOVE LETTER!
IT'S A CHALLENGE LETTER!

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:03.420
I'VE NEVER SEEN ANYONE WRITE
A CHALLENGE LETTER

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:06.000
ON THIS KINDA CUTSEY-POOTSY PAPER
WITH SUCH DAINTY HANDWRITING!

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:07.670
YES, YOU HAVE! BECAUSE IT'S RIGHT THERE!

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:09.330
What are you so embarrassed about?

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:12.210
Boys fall in love with girls all the time!

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:14.210
There's nothing to be ashamed of!

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:15.460
U-uh, well...

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:17.170
She's absolutely right, Master Tobimaro!

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:19.500
You heard the ladies, Ton! Now fight me!

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:21.080
Quit jumping to conclusions already!

00:19:21.710 --> 00:19:23.000
I know you can win, Master Tobimaro.

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:24.250
Do it for me!

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:38.380
Master Tobimaro!

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:44.500
That was a cheap move, Ton!
How dare you rely on Ryoko for help!

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:46.380
How the hell was that helping?!

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:47.130
Hey!
Dammit!<b></b>

00:19:47.130 --> 00:19:49.960
This sucks! She always ruins it for me!

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:52.670
Master Tobimaro! Keep it up!

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:55.460
Look out! You'll trip on that rock!

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:57.960
Master Tobimaro! Grab onto this!

00:19:57.960 --> 00:19:59.670
Quit running!

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:01.920
Only a coward attacks
an unarmed opponent, you know!

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:02.250
Who are you calling a coward?!

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:03.750
Give Master Tobimaro a weapon!
Who are you calling a coward?!<b></b>

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:04.380
Roger!
Who are you calling a coward?!<b></b>

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:06.420
Master Tobimaro! Here!

00:20:06.670 --> 00:20:08.210
<b>KER-SLAM!</b>

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:30.210
Master Tobimaro! How could you
leave me alone like this!

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:32.960
Dear god. Your sick of idea of fun
really knows no bounds.

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:36.790
If this was actually enough to kill him,
then he would've been dead ages ago.

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:40.210
Master Tobimaro!

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:42.710
What's the matter?

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:46.670
Master Tobimaro! Come back!

00:20:46.960 --> 00:20:48.040
<b>KABOOM</b>

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:54.790
Oh, Master Tobimaro!

00:20:56.130 --> 00:20:57.630
I'm so happy!

00:20:58.210 --> 00:21:02.170
W-wow, he really came back to her
after taking all that abuse...

00:21:02.380 --> 00:21:04.670
Simply incredible! I see it now!

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:07.130
Your feelings are legit, Ton!
I shall give you Ryoko!

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:07.880
Hooray!

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:09.670
Like I said before, I'm not interested...

00:21:09.670 --> 00:21:10.710
Go now and elope!

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:12.210
He's still alive and kicking!
You should hurry before I change my mind!<b></b>

00:21:12.210 --> 00:21:13.960
Yeah. That guy is built tough.
You should hurry before I change my mind!<b></b>

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:15.460
You gotta listen to me, Shu...
Seriously!<b></b>

00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:47.080
On the next episode of "Urusei Yatsura".

00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:50.330
<b>Anko Pathos, the Taste of Love?!</b>

00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:50.330
<b>Memories and a Close Call...</b>

00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:50.330
<b>Adverse Effects</b>

00:22:47.080 --> 00:22:50.080
THIS IS THE HAPPIEST MOMENT OF MY LIIIIIIIFE!
